{"text": "In a little part of New York called Greenwich Village, the streets run crazily and cross each other in strange ways. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Artists soon came to live there because the rooms were old and cheap. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the top of a short brick building, Sue and Johnsy had their studio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They had met in May at a cheap restaurant and found that their tastes in art were the same. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So they decided to share a studio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In November a cold, unseen stranger, whom the doctors called Pneumonia, walked through the Village. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He touched one person here and another there with his icy fingers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One of the people he touched was Johnsy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She lay in her bed, hardly moving, and looked through the window at the brick wall of the next house.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "Y", "o", "r", "k", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "G", "r", "e", "e", "n", "w", "i", "c", "h", " ", "V", "i", "l", "l", "a", "g", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", "s", " ", "r", "u", "n", " ", "c", "r", "a", "z", "i", "l", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "r", "o", "s", "s", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "i", "n", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "w", "a", "y", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "r", "t", "i", "s", "t", "s", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "h", "e", "a", "p", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", 